('AeroQ','Marketing Intern','marketing-intern-aeroq','Marketing','Doha, Qatar','Internship','Hybrid','2026-08-30',1,'Create campaigns and content that explain innovative aviation products.','Marketing, communications, or business student.','Excellent writing and an interest in technology.','active'),
('MedLoop','Operations Intern','operations-intern-medloop','Operations','Doha, Qatar','Internship','On-site','2026-08-25',1,'Improve processes supporting healthcare partners and product delivery.','Operations, business, or engineering student.','Organized, analytical, and comfortable collaborating.','active'),
